WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.061
Bird and Kip looked around.

2
00:00:07.062 --> 00:00:09.658
Snow was everywhere.

3
00:00:09.659 --> 00:00:12.007
It covered the ground.

4
00:00:12.008 --> 00:00:15.651
It covered the tree branches.

5
00:00:15.652 --> 00:00:18.920
"Let's make a snowman!" said Kip.

6
00:00:18.921 --> 00:00:22.071
"That sounds like fun," said Bird.

7
00:00:22.072 --> 00:00:27.489
Kip made a snowball.

8
00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:30.578
He rolled the snowball in the snow.

9
00:00:30.579 --> 00:00:37.084
The snowball grew bigger and bigger.

10
00:00:37.085 --> 00:00:41.587
Bird made a snowball.

11
00:00:41.588 --> 00:00:44.249
She rolled the snowball in the snow.

12
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:50.699
The snowball grew bigger and bigger.

13
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.230
Bird and Kip lifted Bird's snowball.

14
00:00:54.231 --> 00:00:58.050
They put it onto Kip's snowball.

15
00:00:58.051 --> 00:01:02.729
Then they put a small snowball on top.

16
00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:06.638
"Our snowman is almost done," said Kip.

17
00:01:06.639 --> 00:01:12.644
"He needs a face and arms," said Bird.

18
00:01:12.645 --> 00:01:15.752
"I'll look for sticks," said Kip.

19
00:01:15.753 --> 00:01:22.669
"I'll look for pebbles," said Bird.

20
00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:29.699
As Kip walked around, the wind blew.

21
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:32.645
It shook the branches.

22
00:01:32.646 --> 00:01:39.264
Snow fell on Kip's head.

23
00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:41.709
"Bird!" cried Kip.

24
00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:46.413
"Someone threw a snowball at me!"

